// CACHE: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits | owner=CodeEditorLand | repo=Cocoon | per_page=5 | page=23 → GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits.RESPONSE.map(Author,Date,File,Message,SHA)
{
	"Set": [
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T20:23:34Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠃⠀⠀⠀",
				1198,
				300
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Expand ESBuild and Mountain configurations for readability\n\nThe ESBuild configuration files in Configuration/ESBuild/ and the Mountain gRPC configuration in Configuration/Mountain/Config.js were previously minified with single-letter variables and compressed formatting. This change expands all configuration files to use descriptive variable names, proper formatting, meaningful comments, and structured exports.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Configuration/ESBuild/: All config files (Bootstrap.js, Cocoon.js, Base/Config.js, Bootstrap/Config.js, Compile/Config.js, Target/Config.js, Constant/Environment/Constant.js, Target.js, index.js) rewritten with clear naming (Environment, BootstrapConfig, CocoonESBuildConfig, TargetConfig, Merge, TierDefines) and explanatory comments for complex logic like the banner injection for CJS require shim and outdir/outbase conflict avoidance.\n- Configuration/Mountain/Config.js: Complete rewrite adding named functions (loadMountainConfigFromEnv, validateMountainConfig, createMountainConfig, getMountainConfigSummary) with JSDoc-style structure, proper validation logic, and configuration summary output.\n- Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts: Routine timestamp regeneration (2026-06-10T20:14:00Z).\n- Target/: Compiled artifacts regenerated as expected from the configuration changes.\n\nImpact: Build configuration is now self-documenting and maintainable, eliminating the need for external documentation to understand ESBuild options and Mountain gRPC client settings.",
			"SHA": "ede8662feae3a7be7dd4001592c7001fcbf1ed53"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T20:22:25Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1255,
				5
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Regenerate RouteManifest timestamp\n\nThe RouteManifest generation timestamp was updated from 2026-06-10T15:20:08Z to 2026-06-10T15:20:42Z in the generated source file. Corresponding compiled artifacts in Target/Generated/ and the TypeScript build info (tsconfig.tsbuildinfo) were also refreshed as part of the regeneration cycle.\n\nThis is a routine build artifact update with no functional code changes.",
			"SHA": "e150dfdd48ded52c77dff5343aef38ea09242c90"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T15:20:44Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1255,
				16
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Update IPC channel response creation and streamline Wind Codegen types resolution\n\n- Replace direct property assignment with spread syntax for conditional error and headers inclusion in CreateResponseMessage and CreateEventMessage\n- Add @ts-ignore comments to suppress import errors for Wind Codegen types that are resolved from Target at runtime\n- Update tsconfig.json path mapping, removing alias for @codeeditorland/wind/Target/Codegen/*\n- Regenerate RouteManifest timestamp\n\nThis change improves IPC message construction and resolves type import issues for runtime-resolved modules.",
			"SHA": "1eb254473a6f0b173c6fed459c47d81841913026"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T15:19:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠁⠀⠀⠀",
				1255,
				281
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Minify ESBuild configuration files\n\nThe ESBuild configuration files in the Cocoon component have been minified to reduce bundle size and improve build performance. This change affects all configuration files in the Configuration/ESBuild directory, including Bootstrap.js, Cocoon.js, and related target configurations.\n\nThe minification process involved shortening variable names and removing unnecessary whitespace and comments while preserving functionality. This optimization reduces the overall size of the configuration files without impacting their behavior.",
			"SHA": "e4a6a2c13819161c8821fd1907a7931cbf2838bc"
		},
